<section class="bg-white why-choose-wrap section-content">
    <div class="il-home-container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 text-center">
                <h2 class="heading-h2">Why choose ICICI Lombard?</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="content-wrap">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
                    <h3>Dependable</h3>
                    <div class="para-wrap">
                        <p><strong>You can rely on us at all times.</strong></p>
                        <p>
                            Be it during large calamities like Odisha cyclone or minor accidents like a broken tail-light, we have always stood by our customers in time of need. We have repeatedly introduced industry-leading practices for
                            nearly two decades . So, in times of trouble, be assured, we’ve got your back. We stand by our motto: <strong>“Nibhaye Vaade”.</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 text-right">
                    <img class="lazy img-responsive" src="data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/home-revamp/images/dependable.png" alt="image 1">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="content-wrap">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 text-left appr-img-dth">
                    <img class="lazy img-responsive" src="data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/home-revamp/images/approachable.png" alt="image 1">
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 appr-dth">
                    <h3>Approachable</h3>
                    <div class="para-wrap">
                        <p><strong>You've got a friend in us.</strong></p>
                        <p>
                            Value of insurance is realised when you make a claim. In your hour of need, be it a major surgery or a broken car, you need more than just claim support. Our team comprises highly trained professionals and
                            functional experts to guide you through the right course of action during emergencies. So, don’t hesitate. Any questions you have or any help you need - just reach out to us.
                        </p>
                        <div class="approachable-bottom-links">
                            <h4>We are available where you are.</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Call centre</li>
                                <li>Chat</li>
                                <li>286 branches</li>
                            </ul>
                            <span>(As on June 30, 2022)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="content-wrap content-wrap-transp">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
                    <h3>Transparent</h3>
                    <div class="para-wrap">
                        <p><strong>We give you the power of clarity.</strong></p>
                        <p>
                            Insurance products are designed and priced through complicated mathematical models. But we strive to explain the extent of coverage to you in a simple manner. From policy issuance to claims, you can count on us
                            for keeping it simple. We have always gone the extra mile to make things clear, right from pre-sales to claims support.
                        </p>
                        <div class="write-us-link">
                            <p>Have ideas to make us more transparent?</p>
                            <a class="js-feedback" href="/feedback">write to us</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 text-right">
                    <img class="lazy img-responsive" src="data:image/png;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/home-revamp/images/transparent.png" alt="image 1">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- why choose block ends here -->
<!-- IL take care app block start here -->
